1
00:00:00,450 --> 00:00:09,120
Open index dot H T M L in your browser, select Start 128
K, then click the display to connect your

2
00:00:09,120 --> 00:00:09,533
keyboard.

3
00:00:09,753 --> 00:00:15,796
In the Spectrum menu, press Down twice to highlight
Calculator, then press Enter.

4
00:00:20,330 --> 00:00:28,882
Each box is a cell. Click a cell, or use the arrow keys,
to select it. The cyan headers show your current

5
00:00:28,882 --> 00:00:30,048
row and column.

6
00:00:30,268 --> 00:00:39,741
The F X bar shows the selected cell's contents. The
toolbar provides Edit, Clear, Copy, Help, and Exit.

7
00:00:40,970 --> 00:00:49,367
Let's build a small shopping list. Enter Item in A one,
Quantity in B one, Price in C one, and Total in D

8
00:00:49,367 --> 00:00:53,747
one. We use Q T Y as a short label for Quantity.

9
00:00:53,967 --> 00:00:59,701
Typing starts a new entry. Press Enter to confirm it and
move down one row.

10
00:01:05,330 --> 00:01:13,013
For the first item, enter Pens in A two, a quantity of
three in B two, and a price of two point five zero

11
00:01:13,013 --> 00:01:13,973
in C two.

12
00:01:14,193 --> 00:01:21,012
On row three, enter Notebooks, a quantity of two, and a
price of four point seven five.

13
00:01:21,232 --> 00:01:24,766
You can use either a decimal point or a decimal comma.

14
00:01:41,690 --> 00:01:49,923
Select D two and type equals B two times C two. Use the
asterisk for multiplication, then press Enter.

15
00:01:50,143 --> 00:01:58,379
The result is seven point five. Select D two again to
see the saved formula in the F X bar. Every formula

16
00:01:58,379 --> 00:02:00,251
begins with an equals sign.

17
00:02:01,490 --> 00:02:09,068
Select D two. Drag the small square at its bottom-right
corner down to D three, and release the mouse.

18
00:02:09,288 --> 00:02:18,014
The copied formula becomes B three times C three, giving
nine point five. Relative references adjust

19
00:02:18,014 --> 00:02:21,831
automatically. Copying replaces any existing destination
contents.

20
00:02:23,050 --> 00:02:33,892
Put the label Total in C four. In D four, enter equals
SUM, open parenthesis, D two, colon, D three, close

21
00:02:33,892 --> 00:02:34,408
parenthesis.

22
00:02:34,628 --> 00:02:41,998
This adds both line totals and gives seventeen. Put the
sum outside its own range to avoid a circular

23
00:02:41,998 --> 00:02:42,386
reference.

24
00:02:43,610 --> 00:02:51,996
To edit existing contents, select a cell and click the F
X bar, or choose Edit. Backspace removes a

25
00:02:51,996 --> 00:02:52,438
character.

26
00:02:52,658 --> 00:03:01,640
The yellow bar shows your pending entry. Cancel, or
Escape, discards the edit. We first cancel a trial

27
00:03:01,640 --> 00:03:04,135
change, keeping the original value.

28
00:03:04,355 --> 00:03:12,295
Now change B two from three to four and choose Save. The
formulas recalculate, and the grand total becomes

29
00:03:12,295 --> 00:03:13,548
nineteen point five.

30
00:03:14,770 --> 00:03:22,538
To erase a cell, select it and click Clear, or press
Delete. Here we add and then clear a temporary note

31
00:03:22,538 --> 00:03:23,648
in A six.

32
00:03:23,868 --> 00:03:31,026
Our shopping list and its formulas stay in place. Always
check the selected cell address before clearing.

33
00:03:32,250 --> 00:03:39,594
The sheet has eight columns, A through H, and sixty-four
rows. Four columns and sixteen rows are visible

34
00:03:39,594 --> 00:03:40,818
at a time.

35
00:03:41,038 --> 00:03:48,567
Use the controls below the grid to switch column pages
or jump sixteen rows. The up and down buttons move

36
00:03:48,567 --> 00:03:51,956
by sixteen rows. Your data remains as you navigate.

37
00:03:57,810 --> 00:04:05,745
For keyboard copying, select the source cell and press F
five. Use the arrows to choose the destination

38
00:04:05,745 --> 00:04:09,713
corner. Enter applies the copy, and Escape cancels it.

39
00:04:09,933 --> 00:04:18,025
We first cancel, then repeat and apply. You can also use
Copy, click the destination, and choose Apply.

40
00:04:18,025 --> 00:04:22,970
Dollar signs keep references fixed, as in dollar A
dollar one.

41
00:04:24,170 --> 00:04:34,537
Press F four, or click Help, to open the formula
reference. It lists SUM, AVERAGE, MIN, MAX, and COUNT,

42
00:04:34,537 --> 00:04:35,628
with examples.

43
00:04:35,848 --> 00:04:42,451
Function names are in English. Return to the sheet with
Enter, Escape, or the button at the bottom.

44
00:04:43,690 --> 00:04:50,978
Click Exit, or press Escape outside an edit, to return
to the Spectrum menu. Reopen Calculator to continue

45
00:04:50,978 --> 00:04:54,218
with your cells in the same browser session.

46
00:04:54,438 --> 00:05:03,065
Keep the page open. Reloading or closing it discards the
sheet. This version has no file save or C S V

47
00:05:03,065 --> 00:05:05,940
export; Save only confirms the current cell.

48
00:05:06,160 --> 00:05:08,784
You are ready to build your own sheet.
